<title>USA: Deschutes Cty Ore., won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Deschutes Cty Ore., won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it won $25.395 million of Deschutes Cty, Ore., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.469 percent.</p>
</text>
